<template>
<section v-pre id="tprmView" class="view">
          <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CYBERSECURITY GOVERNANCE</p><h2>Third-Party Risk Management (TPRM) Sektor Keuangan</h2><p class="lede">Kelola risiko keamanan siber dari vendor teknologi, penyedia jasa pembayaran, mitra data, dan pihak ketiga dalam satu ruang kerja.</p></div><span class="file-count">TPRM</span></div>
<div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ASSESSMENT & RISK</p><h3>Kritikalitas, inherent risk, dan residual risk</h3><p class="muted">Data belum lengkap berstatus Incomplete. Kritikalitas vendor menentukan prioritas review; keputusan penerimaan memakai residual risk dan verifikasi kontrol kritis.</p></div></div><div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><table class="tprm-tier-table"><tbody><tr><td>1-3</td><td><strong>Vendor criticality</strong><small>Nilai tertinggi dari sensitivitas data, akses sistem, dampak bisnis, dan kesulitan penggantian vendor.</small></td></tr><tr><td>0-100</td><td><strong>Inherent risk</strong><small>Nilai tertinggi dari risiko CIA dan inherent rating pada risiko terkait.</small></td></tr><tr><td>0-100</td><td><strong>Residual risk</strong><small>Nilai tertinggi dari residual rating risiko terkait. Tanpa gap, wajib ada alasan hasil identifikasi dan skor CIA yang lengkap.</small></td></tr></tbody></table></article><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">APPROVAL GATES</p><h3>Kontrol kritis dan bukti</h3></div></div><p class="muted">Kegagalan kontrol akses, enkripsi, insiden, atau kontinuitas menghalangi approval. Semua jawaban dan bukti harus lengkap, ditinjau reviewer, lalu disetujui pengguna lain yang berwenang.</p><p class="muted">Gunakan tombol Workflow pada TPRM Risk Register untuk menjalankan tahapan dan melihat riwayat assessment.</p></article></div>
          <div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">PURPOSE & SCOPE</p><h3>Tata kelola mitra jasa keuangan</h3></div></div><p class="muted">Framework ini mengatur vendor yang mengakses, memproses, atau mengembangkan sistem dengan data nasabah, transaksi, atau layanan kritikal, termasuk penyedia core banking, cloud, payment gateway, credit bureau, e-KYC, collection, dan contact center.</p><div class="tprm-tags"><span>UU PDP dan ketentuan perlindungan data nasabah</span><span>Ketentuan OJK/BI terkait penyelenggaraan TI</span><span>Data nasabah & transaksi</span><span>Audit readiness</span></div></article><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">POLICY OWNER</p><h3>CISO + Manajemen Risiko + Procurement + Legal/Compliance</h3></div></div><p class="muted">Version 1.0 · Internal — Confidential</p><p class="muted">Review cadence: annual, dan setiap terjadi perubahan material pada vendor atau alur data nasabah, transaksi, atau layanan kritikal.</p></article></div>
<div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">VENDOR LIFECYCLE</p><h3>Assessment sampai penutupan hubungan</h3></div></div><div class="tprm-lifecycle"><article><b>01</b><h4>Register & Assessment</h4><p>Profil kritikalitas, kuesioner, bukti, CIA, dan risiko terkait.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h4>Review</h4><p>Validasi bukti, kontrol kritis, residual risk, PIC dan tenggat mitigasi.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h4>Approval</h4><p>Approved, Approved with Conditions, atau Rejected oleh approver yang berbeda dari reviewer.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h4>Contract & Activation</h4><p>Verifikasi kontrak, syarat sebelum aktivasi, batas akses, dan jadwal review.</p></article><article><b>05</b><h4>Monitoring</h4><p>Pantau tenggat, masa berlaku bukti, perubahan layanan, dan insiden. Jalankan assessment ulang bila diperlukan.</p></article><article><b>06</b><h4>Offboarding</h4><p>Cabut akses, selesaikan data dan kewajiban, lalu verifikasi bukti penutupan.</p></article></div>
<div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">DUE DILIGENCE</p><h3>Bukti kontrol vendor</h3></div></div><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Data & access</strong><span>Lingkup pemrosesan data, hak akses, dan subprocessor</span></li><li><strong>Security program</strong><span>Program keamanan, audit, sertifikasi dan penanganan kerentanan</span></li><li><strong>Incident & continuity</strong><span>Notifikasi insiden, rencana respons, BCP/DRP dan hasil pengujian</span></li><li><strong>Secure development</strong><span>Kontrol SDLC sesuai layanan vendor; N/A harus dijelaskan</span></li></ul></article><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">RESIDUAL RISK</p><h3>Keputusan berdasarkan risiko setelah kontrol</h3></div></div><table class="tprm-tier-table"><tbody><tr><td>0-39</td><td><strong>Low Risk</strong><small>Tetap memerlukan review, approval, dan kontrak sebelum aktivasi.</small></td></tr><tr><td>40-69</td><td><strong>Medium Risk</strong><small>Mitigasi terbuka memerlukan approval bersyarat dan batas akses.</small></td></tr><tr><td>70-100</td><td><strong>High Risk</strong><small>Wajib alasan penerimaan risiko dan masa berlaku approval.</small></td></tr></tbody></table></article></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SCOPE</p><h3>In scope and out of scope</h3></div></div><div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table tprm-framework-table"><thead><tr><th>In scope</th><th>Out of scope</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-translate-ui>Penyedia core banking, mobile banking, payment gateway, e-KYC, cloud, dan analitik risiko</td><td data-translate-ui>Pemasok umum, kecuali mengakses data nasabah atau sistem kritikal</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Penyedia SaaS yang menyimpan atau memproses data nasabah/transaksi</td><td data-translate-ui>Office supplies and non-IT services</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Penyedia cloud, data center, dan managed service untuk layanan keuangan</td><td data-translate-ui>Janitorial/facilities, unless they access secure areas</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Mitra payment collection, notifikasi, dan delivery yang menerima data nasabah</td><td></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Penyedia credit scoring, fraud detection, dan layanan AML/CFT</td><td></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Setiap vendor dengan akses logis ke data nasabah, transaksi, atau sistem kritikal</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">DUE DILIGENCE PROCESS</p><h3>Questionnaire to GO / NO-GO</h3></div></div><div class="tprm-lifecycle"><article><b>01</b><h4>Vendor questionnaire</h4><p>Self-attestation covering data processing, sub-processors, certifications, incidents, SDLC, and continuity.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h4>Technical review</h4><p>Validate evidence, penetration tests, vulnerability management, access controls, and architecture.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h4>Risk scoring</h4><p>Score data nasabah dan data keuangan exposure, security maturity, financial stability, and reputation from 0 to 100.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h4>GO / NO-GO</h4><p>Approve, reject, or require remediation and CISO approval before onboarding.</p></article></div><div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><table class="tprm-tier-table"><tbody><tr><td>40%</td><td><strong>data nasabah dan data keuangan/Data Exposure</strong><small>Volume, sensitivity, access level, and data subject count</small></td></tr><tr><td>30%</td><td><strong>Security Maturity</strong><small>Certifications, pen tests, vulnerability program, incident history</small></td></tr><tr><td>10%</td><td><strong>Financial Stability</strong><small>Revenue, years in business, and insurance coverage</small></td></tr><tr><td>20%</td><td><strong>Reputation & References</strong><small>Client references, public breaches, and legal actions</small></td></tr></tbody></table></article><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">QUESTIONNAIRE</p><h3>Minimum coverage</h3></div></div><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Data processing</strong><span>Scope and sub-processor inventory</span></li><li><strong>Security evidence</strong><span>Certifications, audit history, and incidents</span></li><li><strong>Secure SDLC</strong><span>Required for software developers</span></li><li><strong>Continuity</strong><span>Business continuity and disaster recovery</span></li></ul></article></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTRACTING</p><h3>Required contractual provisions</h3></div></div><div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table tprm-framework-table"><thead><tr><th>Clause</th><th>Requirement / purpose</th><th>Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-translate-ui>Data Processing Agreement (perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan)</td><td data-translate-ui>Mandatory for all data nasabah dan data keuangan processors</td><td data-translate-ui>Standard perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan Template</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Processing Instructions</td><td data-translate-ui>Only on documented instructions from Company</td><td data-translate-ui>UU PDP(3)(a)</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Ketentuan OJK/BI terkait penyelenggaraan TI</td><td data-translate-ui>No sale/sharing; limited use; no data combination</td><td data-translate-ui>Ketentuan perlindungan data nasabah</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Audit Rights</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual and for-cause audit at Company discretion</td><td></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Sub-Processor Approval</td><td data-translate-ui>Prior written consent and same perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan obligations</td><td data-translate-ui>UU PDP(2)</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Breach Notification</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 48 hours of discovery</td><td></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Data Return/Deletion</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 30 days; Certificate of Deletion required</td><td></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Liability & Indemnification</td><td data-translate-ui>Vendor liable for breach fines, penalties, and remediation</td><td></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>International Transfers</td><td data-translate-ui>SCC/DPF incorporated where applicable</td><td></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Insurance</td><td data-translate-ui>Cyber Liability minimum $5M per occurrence</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE DEVELOPER CLAUSES</p><h3>Additional control requirements</h3></div></div><div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Code Ownership & IP</strong><span>Company retains custom code and derivative works</span></li><li><strong>Backdoor Prohibition</strong><span>No undisclosed access, telemetry, or data exfiltration</span></li><li><strong>Secure SDLC</strong><span>OWASP SAMM or equivalent with security gates</span></li></ul></article><article class="insight-panel"><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Code Escrow</strong><span>Source code escrow for critical systems</span></li><li><strong>Developer Access</strong><span>Least privilege, session logs, background checks</span></li><li><strong>Change Management</strong><span>PIA for changes affecting data nasabah dan data keuangan processing</span></li></ul></article></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ONGOING MONITORING</p><h3>Cadence, KPI, and escalation</h3></div></div><div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table tprm-framework-table"><thead><tr><th>Activity</th><th>Tier 1 High</th><th>Tier 2 Medium</th><th>Tier 3 Low</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-translate-ui>Security questionnaire</td><td data-translate-ui>Quarterly</td><td data-translate-ui>Biannual</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Evidence request</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual</td><td data-translate-ui>Biannual</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>On-site/Remote audit</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual on-site</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual remote</td><td data-translate-ui>Triennial</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Performance review</td><td data-translate-ui>Quarterly</td><td data-translate-ui>Biannual</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Security scorecard</td><td data-translate-ui>Continuous</td><td data-translate-ui>Continuous</td><td data-translate-ui>Not required</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Dark web / breach monitoring</td><td data-translate-ui>Continuous</td><td data-translate-ui>Continuous</td><td data-translate-ui>Not required</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">KEY PERFORMANCE INDICATORS</p><h3>Required targets</h3></div></div><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Availability</strong><span>>= 99.9%</span></li><li><strong>P1 response</strong><span>< 4 hours</span></li><li><strong>P1 resolution</strong><span>< 24 hours</span></li><li><strong>Unauthorized data nasabah dan data keuangan access</strong><span>0 events</span></li><li><strong>Critical vulnerability</strong><span>< 48 hours</span></li><li><strong>DSAR support</strong><span>< 5 business days</span></li></ul></article><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">MONITORING TOOLS</p><h3>Continuous monitoring</h3></div></div><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Security ratings</strong><span>BitSight, SecurityScorecard</span></li><li><strong>Threat intelligence</strong><span>Recorded Future, Mandiant</span></li><li><strong>Vendor risk platform</strong><span>OneTrust, ServiceNow GRC, ProcessUnity</span></li></ul></article></div>
          <div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table tprm-framework-table"><thead><tr><th>Escalation trigger</th><th>Escalation path</th><th>Response</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-translate-ui>Incident affecting Company data</td><td>CISO -> Data Protection Officer / Compliance -> CEO</td><td data-translate-ui>Immediate, within 2 hours</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Critical vulnerability unpatched &gt; 7 days</td><td>CISO -> Vendor escalation</td><td data-translate-ui>24 hours</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan non-renewal or expiration</td><td>Procurement -> Legal/Compliance -> CISO</td><td data-translate-ui>48 hours</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Financial distress or bankruptcy</td><td>Procurement -> Manajemen Risiko -> Direksi</td><td data-translate-ui>3 business days</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Unapproved sub-processor</td><td>Data Protection Officer / Compliance -> Legal</td><td data-translate-ui>24 hours</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">OFFBOARDING</p><h3>Triggers and checklist</h3></div></div><div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Triggers</strong><span>Termination, non-renewal, bankruptcy, material perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan breach, or in-sourcing</span></li><li><strong>Required actions</strong><span>Data export, access revocation, deletion certificate, monitoring removal</span></li><li><strong>Retention</strong><span>Archive contract, perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan, and records for 7 years</span></li></ul></article><article class="insight-panel"><table class="tprm-tier-table"><tbody><tr><td data-translate-ui>Day 0</td><td><strong>Notify vendor</strong><small>Procurement communicates return/deletion requirements</small></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>30 days</td><td><strong>Export and deletion</strong><small>Receive data export and Certificate of Deletion</small></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>24 hours</td><td><strong>Revoke access</strong><small>Remove accounts, API keys, VPN, and repositories</small></td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>6 months</td><td><strong>Post-termination audit</strong><small>Required for Tier 1 vendors</small></td></tr></tbody></table></article></div>
          <div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table tprm-framework-table"><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Offboarding task</th><th>Timeline</th><th>Owner</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td data-translate-ui>Notify vendor of termination and data return/deletion requirements</td><td data-translate-ui>Day 0</td><td data-translate-ui>Procurement</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td data-translate-ui>Receive complete data export in standard format</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 30 days</td><td>IT</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td data-translate-ui>Verify export completeness and integrity</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 5 days of receipt</td><td data-translate-ui>IT + Business Owner</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td data-translate-ui>Revoke accounts, API keys, VPN, and repositories</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 24 hours</td><td data-translate-ui>IT Security</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td data-translate-ui>Obtain Certificate of Deletion</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 30 days</td><td data-translate-ui>Procurement</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td data-translate-ui>Verify deletion evidence</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 5 days of certificate</td><td data-translate-ui>IT Security</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td data-translate-ui>Remove vendor from approved list and monitoring tools</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 5 days</td><td data-translate-ui>TPRM Team</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td data-translate-ui>Post-termination audit for Tier 1</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 6 months</td><td data-translate-ui>Internal Audit</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td data-translate-ui>Update register pemrosesan data nasabah for vendor removal</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 30 days</td><td data-translate-ui>Compliance / Data Protection</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td data-translate-ui>Archive contract, perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan, and offboarding records</td><td data-translate-ui>Per retention policy</td><td data-translate-ui>Legal</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">GOVERNANCE & ORGANIZATION</p><h3>Roles and TPRM Committee</h3></div></div><div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table tprm-framework-table"><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Responsibility</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-translate-ui>CISO</td><td data-translate-ui>Program owner, technical risk assessment, audit oversight</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Data Protection Officer / Compliance</td><td data-translate-ui>perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan compliance, register pemrosesan data nasabah entries, international transfers</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Procurement</td><td data-translate-ui>RFP, contract negotiation, financial due diligence</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Legal</td><td data-translate-ui>perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan/contract review, liability, regulatory interpretation</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>IT Security</td><td data-translate-ui>Technical assessment, monitoring, access management</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Business Owners</td><td data-translate-ui>Vendor relationship, performance, renewal decisions</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Internal Audit</td><td data-translate-ui>Independent verification and annual effectiveness review</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="muted">TPRM Committee bertemu setiap kuartal dengan agenda onboarding Tier 1/2, high-risk review, escalated issues, process improvement, renewals, dan offboarding.</p>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">AUDIT, ROADMAP & REFERENCES</p><h3>Implementation and standards</h3></div></div><div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Annual IT Audit</strong><span>Audit sample Tier 1, exercise contract clauses, verify register pemrosesan data nasabah/alur data nasabah, transaksi, atau layanan kritikals, assess effectiveness</span></li><li><strong>Month 1-2</strong><span>Inventory vendors, obtain perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaans, tier risks, deploy questionnaire, train procurement</span></li><li><strong>Month 3-4</strong><span>Renegotiate high-risk contracts and deploy monitoring dashboards</span></li><li><strong>Month 5+</strong><span>Integrate annual audit cycle and launch TPRM Committee</span></li><li><strong>Ongoing</strong><span>Quarterly committee meetings and annual effectiveness review</span></li></ul></article><article class="insight-panel"><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>ISO 27001 Annex A.15</strong><span>Supplier relationships</span></li><li><strong>NIST SP 800-53 SA</strong><span>System and Services Acquisition</span></li><li><strong>NIST SP 800-161</strong><span>Supply Chain Risk Management</span></li><li><strong>UU PDP</strong><span>Processor obligations</span></li><li><strong>Ketentuan perlindungan data nasabah</strong><span>Service Provider definition</span></li><li><strong>SOC 2 CC7.2, CC9.2</strong><span>Vendor management trust criteria</span></li></ul></article></div>
          <div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">TOOLS & TEMPLATES</p><h3>Supporting resources</h3></div></div><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Vendor Tiering Matrix</strong><span>Detailed criteria</span></li><li><strong>Due Diligence Questionnaire</strong><span>Vendor assessment</span></li><li><strong>Standard perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan</strong><span>TPRM-specific contract</span></li><li><strong>Software Developer Checklist</strong><span>Technical verification</span></li><li><strong>General perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan Template</strong><span>Privacy contract</span></li><li><strong>register pemrosesan data nasabah Template</strong><span>Processing records</span></li></ul></article><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMITTEE AGENDA</p><h3>Quarterly TPRM Committee</h3></div></div><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>1</strong><span>New Tier 1/2 vendor onboarding approvals</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>High-risk vendor performance and incidents</span></li><li><strong>3</strong><span>Escalated issues and remediation status</span></li><li><strong>4</strong><span>Policy and process improvement proposals</span></li><li><strong>5</strong><span>Upcoming renewals and offboarding</span></li></ul></article></div>
